  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNEP Marine Pollution Initiative Coordination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norway has set up a development assistance programme against marine litter and micro-plastics. MFA and the Indian Ministry of Environment and Forests have signed a letter of intent to establish the India-Norway Marine Pollution Initiative. Under the inititaive, several projects have been identified.The UN Environment India office will play a corrdination role among the different stakeholders that are part of the inititaive,</narrative>
  </description>
